      <Comment source="pmngroup">NIL Phosphoserine aminotransferase (PSAT) is encoded by a single copy gene in Arabidopsis. The identity of the cDNA clone was confirmed by functional complementation of an E. coli auxotrophic mutant lacking the PSAT locus.</Comment>
